:: OC Noah H School Pool Event Help Ben [nobr]

For one reason or another, you’ve ended up on one side of the pool with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise"> Ben</span>, who is nervously holding the side trying to make himself as small as possible. Seems the unathletic boy is taking the chance of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise"> Kohler</span> being distracted to not go into the deep end. You know he isn’t the best swimmer, but curious, you ask him why he isn’t at least giving it a shot to practice. <br>

